      "excerpt": "Pupils in Heywood recently participated in a school linking event organised by the council in collaboration with M6 Theatre, which featured engaging workshops.",
      "content_html": "<p>A school linking event took place in Heywood recently, where pupils participated in workshops led by teams from the council and M6 Theatre. The event aimed to foster collaboration and creativity among students.</p><p>The workshops were designed to be engaging and fun, providing pupils with an opportunity to work closely with theatre professionals. This initiative is part of a broader effort to enhance educational experiences through the arts.</p><p>Participants expressed enthusiasm for the activities, which included various interactive sessions that encouraged teamwork and artistic expression. The collaboration between the council and M6 Theatre highlights the importance of community involvement in education.</p><p>This event is expected to have a positive impact on the pupils, as it promotes not only artistic skills but also social interaction and teamwork among students from different schools.</p>",
